{{en-noun|head=[[lion]][['s]] [[share]]|s|lions' shares}}

# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} The [[majority]]; a [[large]] or [[generous]] [[portion#Noun|portion]].
#: {{ux|en|They got a large donation, but the '''lion’s share''' of the money went straight into paying off debt.}}
